{
  "id": "skill-context-ab-v1",
  "notes": [
    "Isolates SAGA_SKILL_CONTEXT. Skill text is injected only into the",
    "specialist builder brief, so SAGA_INCREMENTAL_BUILD must be 1 in BOTH",
    "arms - with it off the two arms are byte-identical prompts and the run",
    "measures nothing.",
    "Every other variable is pinned per pair: same model, same designer,",
    "same director, same max systems. The only delta is the flag.",
    "The local 14B pair matters most and is listed last: it is where the",
    "extra 3-5k tokens are most likely to help (weakest engine knowledge)",
    "and most likely to hurt (this is the model that drops var declarations",
    "once a prompt outgrows its few-shots). Skip it only if wall time forces",
    "the issue, and say so in the writeup.",
    "Results are not comparable with coder-pilot-v1: the architect contract",
    "now enters every Coder prompt."
  ],
  "repetitions": 1,
